{"id":"torrey:darkness","source":"torrey","name":"Darkness","slug":"darkness","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Created by God — Ps 104:20; Isa 45:7.","refs":[["Ps",104,20,104,20],["Isa",45,7,45,7]]},{"text":"Originally covered the earth — Ge 1:2.","refs":[["Gen",1,2,1,2]]},{"text":"Separated from the light — Ge 1:4.","refs":[["Gen",1,4,1,4]]},{"text":"Called night — Ge 1:5.","refs":[["Gen",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"Caused by the setting of the sun — Ge 15:17; Joh 6:17.","refs":[["Gen",15,17,15,17],["John",6,17,6,17]]},{"text":"Inexplicable nature of — Job 38:19,20.","refs":[["Job",38,19,38,19],["Job",38,20,38,20]]},{"text":"Exhibits God’s power and greatness — Job 38:8,9.","refs":[["Job",38,8,38,8],["Job",38,9,38,9]]},{"text":"Great. — Ge 15:12.","refs":[["Gen",15,12,15,12]]},{"text":"That may be felt. — Ex 10:21.","refs":[["Exod",10,21,10,21]]},{"text":"Thick. — De 5:22; Joe 2:2.","refs":[["Deut",5,22,5,22],["Joel",2,2,2,2]]},{"text":"Gross. — Jer 13:16.","refs":[["Jer",13,16,13,16]]},{"text":"Outer or extreme. — Mt 8:12.","refs":[["Matt",8,12,8,12]]},{"text":"Keeps us from seeing objects. — Ex 10:23.","refs":[["Exod",10,23,10,23]]},{"text":"Causes us to go astray. — Joh 12:35; 1Jo 2:11.","refs":[["John",12,35,12,35],["1John",2,11,2,11]]},{"text":"Causes us to stumble. — Isa 59:10.","refs":[["Isa",59,10,59,10]]},{"text":"Often put for night — Ps 91:6.","refs":[["Ps",91,6,91,6]]},{"text":"Called the swaddling band of the sea — Job 38:9.","refs":[["Job",38,9,38,9]]},{"text":"Cannot hide us from God — Ps 139:11,12.","refs":[["Ps",139,11,139,11],["Ps",139,12,139,12]]},{"text":"The children of. — 1Th 5:5.","refs":[["1Thess",5,5,5,5]]},{"text":"Live in. — Ps 107:10.","refs":[["Ps",107,10,107,10]]},{"text":"Walk in. — Ps 82:5.","refs":[["Ps",82,5,82,5]]},{"text":"Perpetuate their designs in. — Job 24:16.","refs":[["Job",24,16,24,16]]},{"text":"Are full of. — Mt 6:23.","refs":[["Matt",6,23,6,23]]},{"text":"On mount Sinai. — Ex 19:16; Heb 12:18.","refs":[["Exod",19,16,19,16],["He